<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 54,400 MT were two-thirds below last week's marketing-year high and 58 percent under the 4-week average.</p>
<p>Israel (22,900 MT), Egypt (10,500 MT), Turkey (10,000 MT), and Mexico (7,500 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 186,700 MT--a marketing-year high--were nearly three times the previous week and 63 percent over the 4-week average.  The primary destinations were Mexico (87,500 MT) and Japan (67,300 MT).</p>
</text>
